AdrenoMetal.bundle (darwin-lisa): where the source of what is in this bundle is.

AdrenoMetal (the executable) links the metal2vulkan runtime and translator, which are licensed
GPL-2.0-or-later OR LGPL-3.0-or-later. Their complete corresponding source, and the source of
everything else in the bundle, is the following, rebuilt by the scripts named below:

  metal2vulkan   https://github.com/steelbrain/metal2vulkan  commit 720ef1ce9ae2a2068999a8675717418b9416283e
                 + gpu2/patches/metal2vulkan-720ef1c-dada.patch of
                   https://github.com/superboyyy/hakios-arm64e-dada  commit f1ae906fcc43ba8f763663257724ba938fb820ab
                 + kernel/drivers/gpu/unixnu/metal2vulkan-lisa.patch of the darwin-lisa repository
  AdrenoMetal    https://github.com/UniXNU/AdrenoMetal  commit c6d29ca (MIT)
                 + gpu2/patches/nativemetal-dada.patch (as above)
                 + kernel/drivers/gpu/unixnu/nativemetal-lisa.patch of the darwin-lisa repository
  Turnip         https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa  commit 85fda3b36405bcaea8bffc64aa4f2651dc90770d (MIT)
  (libvulkan_freedreno.dylib)
                 + gpu2/patches/mesa-85fda3b-dada.patch (as above)
                 + kernel/drivers/gpu/unixnu/mesa-lisa.patch of the darwin-lisa repository
  AdrenoPM4      https://github.com/UniXNU/AdrenoPM4 (MIT)

Build: kernel/drivers/gpu/unixnu/fetch-src.sh, build-turnip-ios.sh, build-bridge.sh, build-plugin.sh
of the darwin-lisa repository (docs/gpu-driver-rewrite.md, section 9).
